{"id":"tube","lemma":"tube","pos":"noun","rank":2740,"glosses":["pipe","tube","a hit"],"ipa":"/tyb/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e9/Fr-tube.ogg/Fr-tube.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tubes"},"formAudio":{"tubes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-tubes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je veux un gros tube de dentifrice.","en":"I want a large tube of toothpaste.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big, thick, fat"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"toothpaste"}]},{"text":"Chacune de ses chansons était un tube.","en":"Every one of her songs was a hit.","words":[{"g":"each, each one","l":"chacun"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"song","l":"chanson"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tu ne peux pas remettre le dentifrice dans le tube.","en":"You can't put toothpaste back in the tube.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to put back, replace"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"toothpaste"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Elle chante les derniers tubes.","en":"She is singing the latest popular songs.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to sing","l":"chanter"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"last","l":"dernier"},null]},{"text":"Il pressa la pâte dentifrice hors du tube.","en":"He squeezed the toothpaste out of a tube.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to urge","l":"presser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"paste"},{"g":"toothpaste"},{"g":"outside, out of, off"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]}]}